B.aAf=s(["There! That\u2019s how we say it, I confirm.","Good! Even my passengers don\u2019t know that.","Right answer, boss!"],t.s)
B.aPm=s(["Ouch, wrong turn! Let\u2019s go back.","Traffic jam in your head? It happens.","Missed! I\u2019ll drop you at the same spot."],t.s)
